abstract: >-
  BASTION-01 is an open, modular evidence-control system for AI-assisted research.
  It coordinates prior-art discovery, formal reasoning, engineering verification,
  evaluation, process assurance, and adaptive complementary assistance while keeping
  claims scoped to their receipts, uncertainty, and release authority. Rookframe
  Research is the working identity for the planned research company behind the line.
